I'm a huge fan of this podcast and the co founders of Parent are too.

13
00:01:01,280 --> 00:01:02,880
So yeah, hi Kevin, howdyey.

14
00:01:02,880 --> 00:01:02,880
Yeah.

15
00:01:02,880 --> 00:01:02,880
Hi, Kevin.

16
00:01:02,880 --> 00:01:03,280
Hi, Diego.

17
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:04,080
Yeah.

18
00:01:04,400 --> 00:01:05,200
Thank you for having me.

19
