Speaking of Parrot, I was, I actually had you on the list to invite as a guest since you were at Blinkist, but in the meantime you actually joined Parrot.

21
00:01:14,400 --> 00:01:18,240
So tell me a bit about Parrot and what was so exciting about joining the team there.

22
00:01:18,880 --> 00:01:19,200
Of course.

23
00:01:19,600 --> 00:01:22,480
And I hope you're ready for a cheesy story because I always.

24
00:01:24,560 --> 00:01:30,160
So yeah, I mean, what Parrot is, is a fun app for couples designed to bring you closer together.

25
00:01:30,960 --> 00:01:32,080
